== Annotated Siren's Grotto Maps (No Map Location Key) ==

This zone does not have a traditional location key, but a player has [[Annotated Sirens Grotto Maps|annotated the Siren's Grotto maps]] with most of the spawn points and paths of mobile mobs. ('''NOTE:''' Currently missing some of the underwater tunnels).

